+# Turns on MediaTek's own monitor support: NL80211_IFTYPE_MONITOR, radiotap RX,
+# and mtk_cfg80211_set_monitor_channel -> CMD_ID_SET_MONITOR. Passive capture
+# only; no transmit behaviour is changed by these flags. This is the first-test
